# SAM Project Rules

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Drizzle + Neon + Better Auth + Zod.
- Deploy target: Cloudflare Workers via OpenNext. Database: Neon Postgres.
- Ignore `sam-demo/` completely.
- Full-viewport PWA layout — no iOS device frames or phone chrome.
- Prefer Server Actions / Route Handlers over separate Python backend.
- Market ingestion: Cloudflare Cron / route handler or external worker; IBKR live is optional long-running worker.
- Extract and document DB schema before removing Supabase files.
- Do not reintroduce Supabase as an active dependency.
- Make small, reviewable changes.
